abstract: >-
  This dataset contains the input data, intermediate SQLite databases, and
  solution data generated by the sequential multiobjective pipeline described
  in the accompanying paper. The case study concerns multimodal passenger
  transport design for Erding, Germany, including equilibrium and
  line-planning solution stages.
keywords:
  - multimodal transport
  - public transport planning
  - multiobjective optimization
  - Wardrop equilibrium
  - line planning
  - transport data
